      ],
      "dcDescription": [
        "deformed The Magazine - C C02 Madagascar Tissue, sewn on the middle. Striped in different colours with silk embroidery horizontally to the vertical stripes. The warp threads form a fringe down both sides. A paper label is glued to the fabric with no. 204. Be9ileo tissue. D: o [ocr] The tissue has very hard folds after folding. The middle seam is open in several places. Big bright spots, mold. The patches existed before freezing. The bottom of the side has two reefs, a 6 cm long, and a 5 cm long reva. Malpupae removed from the object. Tubes big 3 1913.07.0204 deformerat (veck, skrynklig mm) Mag"
      ],
